# Keep the build context small and free of local-only state. The model
# weights and shade catalog are deliberately INCLUDED: baking them into the
# image keeps cold starts off the network entirely (anonymous HF downloads
# from cloud IPs are rate-limited and blew Cloud Run's startup deadline).
# deploy/fetch_artifacts.py remains the fallback when they're absent.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.expo
**/ios
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
beautylens/beautylens.db
beautylens/.coverage
beautylens/.env
beautylens/data/sources
beautylens/tests/fixtures
docs
